  "description": "A thin, framework-agnostic test harness for incremental source generators and analyzers: runs a generator over in-memory source, asserts the generated code recompiles cleanly, asserts diagnostics by id/severity/location, and -- the part no other package offers -- asserts incremental caching with trackIncrementalGeneratorSteps. Throws its own assertion exception, so it works under xunit, NUnit, MSTest, or TUnit alike.",
